From: polaris port <local@localhost>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sdm845-xiaomi-polaris: add ath10k
 snoc-host-cap-skip-quirk

The WCN3998 WiFi on the polaris refuses to come up with the Xiaomi
supplied firmware unless the snoc host capability quirk is skipped, the
same as on other SDM845 Xiaomi devices.  Without this the ath10k_snoc
driver rejects the firmware and no wlan interface appears.

Add the qcom,snoc-host-cap-skip-quirk property to the &wifi node.

This mirrors Icenowy Zheng's sdm845-mainline MR !85 commit 3e6b21a7
("arm64: dts: qcom: sdm845-xiaomi-polaris: Enable ath10k host cap skip
quirk"), part of the same hotfix series as the panel prepare_prev_first
fix that has not yet been merged into the 7.1 branch.

Signed-off-by: polaris port <local@localhost>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-polaris.dts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-polaris.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-polaris.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-polaris.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-polaris.dts
@@ -712,5 +712,6 @@
 	vdd-1.3-rfa-supply = <&vreg_l17a_1p3>;
 	vdd-3.3-ch0-supply = <&vreg_l25a_3p3>;
 	vdd-3.3-ch1-supply = <&vreg_l23a_3p3>;
+	qcom,snoc-host-cap-skip-quirk;
 	status = "okay";
 };
-- 
